; Second independent audit after the first locale board returned REVISE.
import "../form/form-stdlib/core.fk"
import "review-panel.fk"
import "review-ask.fk"

(ra-review
  "cognition/form-neutral-word-field-locales.fk"
  "Second adversarial verification only; do not edit any file. The first review correctly found that the 91 nested recipes are extensionally a static 7x13 lexical bridge table, not productive or learned generation; that source origin was conflated with speaker review; that zero delta impersonated alignment; that hypotheses were not concept-scoped; that zh and Sanskrit script tags were underspecified; that Chinese 兴奋 wrongly reused an awe hypothesis; and that several fragment boundaries, Balinese surfaces, and Sanskrit स्पष्टीकृ were weak or malformed. Verify the repaired implementation itself. It must now state 91 character-complete static bridges, 61 runtime multi-fragment concatenations, 30 single anchors, and zero productive morphology rules. Realization records must carry hypothesis, source, source reference, speaker-review state, POS, register, script, and exact-NFC-only normalization separately. Every one of 91 rows must remain speaker-unreviewed even when source-anchored. Hypothesis reuse must be axis-validated; hypothesis 0 must mean only no numeric delta authored. 兴奋 must use hypothesis 0, not an awe vector. Locale tags must be de-Latn, zh-Hans, pt-Latn, fr-Latn, id-Latn, ban-Latn, sa-Deva. Check the corrected boundaries Begeister|ung, esclarec|er, memper|jelas and the attested Sanskrit infinitive स्पष्टीकर्तुम्. Balinese harmony/coherence must now be kadungan/kacocokan with external source refs rather than invented kaselarasan/kasalarasan, but source refs still must not imply semantic or speaker validation. The upstream axis 8 definition is relational personal sovereignty: a self knows what it wants and does, without making another less. Therefore autonomy/self-determination surfaces must carry explicit hypothesis 9 relational-agency, never default equivalence; judge fit against that definition, not political state sovereignty, while naming any remaining lexical risk. The fresh local band reports 524287 and observes 91/91 exact identity round trips, invalid-locale and empty-query refusal, source-reference consistency, axis-valid hypotheses, 91 unreviewed/0 reviewed, and the corrected surfaces. Exact reverse matching remains identity only. Return PASS AS AN HONEST STATIC CANDIDATE LOCALE-BRIDGE SEED, REVISE, or BLOCK. Locate any remaining executable overclaim or malformed surface and name the smallest next movement. Empty or unavailable panel doors are absence, never votes.")
